      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW ESTRELLA (2) is a handy type who was well below best latest at Warrnambool, finishing sixth (22.67) in a Free For All. Generally safe to begin but was always well back last time. Has a strong record here at this journey including four wins. Has ability and is a key runner. SWEET LOVE (8) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a head (23.25) behind Mepunga Scarlett at Horsham. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Leading player again. IMPETUOUSLY (1) goes very well at the distance with three wins and a placing from five starts. Comes off a (16.26) win last time, scoring by a neck in a Special conditions race over 300m at Healesville. Looks a key chance on best figures. DURAN OLLY (4) scored a scorching Rank Limit - Grade 5 win in 25.21 last time. Can measure up again.",
